{"time": 1756627334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494447496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在一旁落座，不说话听"}
{"time": 1756627371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990521535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“诸位有所不知，这几天我真是快顶不住了，一个月前就陆陆续续地有兄弟在被袭击，就在你们来之前两个小时，还有新的遇难者。”"}
{"time": 1756627400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809704187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "他也不等碰杯，先给自己猛灌了一杯酒"}
{"time": 1756627457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26752039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“现在整个买卖城充斥着不安的气氛，士兵们疑神疑鬼，士气已经低落的不行了。不止城内，城外骑兵营的也有人遇难。”"}
{"time": 1756627519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244368727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“还有边境的卡伦哨所，不少兄弟死于枪伤，tmd肯定是北边的白毛子干的”"}
{"time": 1756627583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345621868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“也不知道是心理作用还是什么，我这背上啊也老是隐隐地发毛，有种被什么东西窥视的感觉”"}
{"time": 1756627646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887964855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"枪伤?\"开口，\"检查过子弹吗？\""}
{"time": 1756627778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648577916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“7.62子弹造成的贯穿伤，顾营长应该很熟悉吧。身体里也能取出子弹”"}
{"time": 1756627826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808043430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“刚刚的新的遇难者呢？也是一样的枪伤吗？”"}
{"time": 1756627826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888387110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "（大伙能不能id改成卡名）"}
