{"time": 1757074143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852334359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1041771201]“怎么样，有没有感觉稍微好一些”"}
{"time": 1757074148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369766516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“大夫，非常感谢你们的帮助”他终于恢复了正常的交流能力"}
{"time": 1757074251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132340029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "“看起来你好多了，你希望和我说说之前发生的事情吗？如果你觉得说出来会让你痛苦那我们就不谈了”"}
{"time": 1757074255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146652039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“应该好很多了吧，身为一名边军我居然被吓成这样……”他的耳朵都有些发红"}
{"time": 1757074304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174402778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1146652039]“这不是你的问题，作为人类的我们与自然相比肯定是渺小的，你也不必自责，你已经做得很好了”"}
{"time": 1757074322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678103005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“非常感谢……那我就从头开始说起”"}
{"time": 1757074340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870411751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "*拿出笔记本准备随时记录"}
{"time": 1757074444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135516626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“我们之所以在营房里聚餐，是买卖城内有个裹着大衣的阔佬，他每天都在市集上大肆扫货，好多商铺都要断货了。排长提议我们赶紧聚一餐，否则之后可能好几天都没法打牙祭了。我们在缺货前买到了东西，就聚在营房里。没想到……“”"}
{"time": 1757074593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168260367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“这个裹着大衣的阔佬是谁？还有什么特征吗？”"}
