{"time": 1757081090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855547940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "那个商人懒洋洋地坐在躺椅上“都在柜子里，看上什么了跟我说”"}
{"time": 1757081231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011317675", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在店铺里面看来"}
{"time": 1757081234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524904978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在店铺里面看看"}
{"time": 1757081275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112243171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "这间店铺主要贩卖肉制品，在当地又被称为乌兰伊得"}
{"time": 1757081340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838803091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "都是些处理好的食物，肥牛肉、手抓羊肉、筒子骨什么的"}
{"time": 1757081443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126432191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"最近城里有什么有趣的事吗？\"一边说着，拍拍自己的军装，抬手拿一块牛肉"}
{"time": 1757081544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306607260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "翻译云登把话翻译成了蒙古语，商人抬头看了你一眼，发觉居然是个军官，忙不迭坐了起来"}
{"time": 1757081581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872777625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“回军爷，最近听说城外很不安分，城内倒是不知道您要打听什么事”"}
{"time": 1757081601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295021949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（军爷出来不换军装吗（）"}
{"time": 1757081607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991477562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（唉军✌🏻"}
{"time": 1757082460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552237054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1872777625]\"没事，只是我初来此地驻防。\"停顿一下，\"尽管说说城里的事情。\""}
{"time": 1757082465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1313363022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为啥换，没换的必要)"}
{"time": 1757082748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410861973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“要说有什么事情的话，也就最近来了个叫图门•乌力吉的，在我们这到处扫货。不过别的我也没多问，实在是不好意思。”"}
{"time": 1757082852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016449610", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?他做了什么，奇货可居之心可不能有。\"瞥一眼他"}
{"time": 1757082864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032167429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?他扫了什么，奇货可居之心可不能有。\"瞥一眼他"}
{"time": 1757083133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835759025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“我们这卖的无非就是些肉干、白酒、茶砖以及其他食物，你去问问别的商家，肯定也都是这个回答”"}
{"time": 1757083226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54095795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你的意思是，他来扫这么多吃食?\"皱着眉，\"这边的食物都是哪个商号供应的。\""}
